request.description:
GET /hospital/me — user, role, permissions[], hospital summary incl. ``read_only`` (D-30) and
the default counter (v2 §7.2). PATCH /hospital/me (v1 §7.3.1) edits the user's own name/locale;
identity edits are exempt from the read-only gate (login is never cut off, D-30).

